text.section:
When the affairs of a protected series have been wound up, the series limited liability company that established the protected series shall deliver to the Commission for filing a statement of designation cancellation setting forth:

The name of the protected series;


The identification number issued by the Commission to the protected series;


The name of the series limited liability company that established the protected series;


The effective date of the certificate of protected series designation;


A statement that the protected series has completed the winding up its affairs; and


Any other information that the associated members of the protected series determine to include therein, including the reason for the filing of the statement of designation cancellation.
